{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24675","headline":"道场独坐 · 白居易","name":"道场独坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"整顿衣巾拂净牀，一瓶秋水一炉香。\n不论烦恼先须去，直到菩提亦拟忘。\n朝谒久停收劒佩，宴游渐罢废壶觞。\n世间无用残年处，祗合逍遥坐道场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}